# [ Claude (Cowork) | Claude Opus 5 (claude-opus-5) | 2026-08-03 14:52 UTC | edit: stray editor artifacts ]
# An interactive editor session on 2026-08-03 created a default "Untitled" level and its
# World Partition sidecars - 143 files that no phase references and nothing loads. Scoped
# to Untitled deliberately: __ExternalActors__ and __ExternalObjects__ are where a real
# World Partition level would keep its actors, so ignoring those directories wholesale
# would silently stop tracking a future level's content. Delete the files if you want
# them gone; this only stops them appearing as untracked noise on every status.
sandbox/Content/Untitled.umap
sandbox/Content/Untitled_HLOD0_Instancing.uasset
sandbox/Content/__ExternalActors__/Untitled/
sandbox/Content/__ExternalObjects__/Untitled/

# Game Animation Sample: local asset library (Epic content license), 5.9 GB.
# Stays OUT of the repo; selected assets migrate into sandbox/Content deliberately,
# each migration audited (docs/phase0/asset_audits/) and committed on its own.
GameAnimationSample/

# [ Claude (Cowork) | Claude Fable 5 (claude-fable-5) | 2026-08-04 17:32 UTC | edit: Mixamo source library ]
# Mixamo FBX source library (28 clips, audited: docs/phase0/asset_audits/2026-08-04-mixamo-boxing-set.md).
# Mixamo terms permit shipping clips embedded in the game but not redistributing the
# animation files themselves - so the raw FBX never enters the repo. Imported/retargeted
# uassets land in sandbox/Content during the mannequin pass, citing the audit.
mixamo_boxing/
